The core gap: **freeing an inode on one node does not invalidate peers' cached copies**, so on reuse, peers serve a stale-type inode. This is the sess40/48/52 inode-reuse coherency family. Let me confirm the hole: does the inode free/inactivate path do any peer DLM invalidation?
